      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">and a coat made of different materials\u2014two dinars, five skullcaps\u2014three dinars, [a ... half-mantle\u2014one dinar]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and a half, three pillows\u2014one dinar, a shawl\u2014one and a half dinar. The sum total is eight dina[rs. And they stipulated]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">between themselves that if this Mevorakh b. R. Japheth hates this Dal\u0101l, the bride, daughter of Ya\u1e25ye, and does not [desire]\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">her partnership, and wants to divorce her, he will pay to her the balance of her mohar, from beginning to end,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">even from the shirt on his back. And we performed a complete qinyan, with a suitable instrument, with Mevorakh b. Japheth,\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the groom, (to affirm) that he not alter the law of the Rabbanites on all their festivals and fast days, and all of their laws. And she will conduct herself\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">with him according to his law, and this Dal\u0101l daughter of Ya\u1e25ye will not desecrate his law in his presence. They took upon themselves the security of this\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">deed, according to the stringencies of the deeds established by the sages. We performed with them a complete strict qinyan with an instrument suitable\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">for this for all that is written and specified. Valid and trustworthy in whatever court it is produced and read,\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">whether in the laws of the gentiles or the statutes of our lords and sages. In good order.\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Obadiah ha-Ko[hen ...]. Jephthah ha-Kohen b. R. Joseph (whose) s(oul is at) r(est) b. Amram (whose) s(oul is at) r(est).</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Jo[seph(?) ...\u00a0 </li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
